    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Video → Canva\n**Form → Gemini script → YOU EDIT → 2D images using cloudefare fluxschnell + Gemini voice per scene → upload to Canva**\n\n1. Fill keys in **Config** (Gemini key, Canva access token)\n2. Click **Execute workflow** / open the Form Trigger test URL\n3. Review the script on the edit page, change it or leave blank to approve\n4. Final page gives you the Canva design link\n\nCanva tokens from the Connect API expire (~4h). Later switch to an OAuth2 credential.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520
      },
      "name": "Setup Notes1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
